==Event Information==
An incredible breakthrough! The Battle Cats has reached 70 Million installs thanks to players like you from all over the world! And now, the Battle Cats team wants to show you our gratitude by celebrating this amazing milestone with special stages, events, and rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On May 16th (11:00am) through June 6th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Special 70 Million Downloads Event Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages from The Battle Cats title menu and tap Start! to challenge special stages, available for a limited time only!

※ If event stages do not appear as scheduled, please make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent available version.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●70 Million Downloads Celebration Map!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend/Event Stages to take on the limited map {{Color|#FF00FF|'''70M Celebration Gifts Galore!'''}} and earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} upon clearing the stage! After your victory, {{Color|#339966|'''the stage will disappear, but the stage will reappear once again each day at 12:00am while the event is available!'''}}

When the stage reappears, {{Color|#339966|'''all rewards will become available once again'''}}, allowing you to pick up another Cat Food reward every day! Clear the stage once every day to collect {{Color|#FF0000|'''a maximum of 440 Cat Food in total'''}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to 30,000,000 XP by clearing the stage!<br>
Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next Gauntlet stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|Blitz XP}},  {{Color|#FF00FF|XP Megablitz}}, {{Color|#FF00FF|XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP}} at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/16, 5/18, 5/20, 5/22, 5/24, 5/26, 5/28, 5/30, 6/1, 6/3, 6/5'''}}　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/17, 5/19, 5/21, 5/23, 5/25, 5/27, 5/29, 5/31, 6/2, 6/4'''}}　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/16, 5/18, 5/20, 5/22, 5/24, 5/26, 5/28, 5/30, 6/1, 6/3, 6/5'''}}　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/17, 5/19, 5/21, 5/23, 5/25, 5/27, 5/29, 5/31, 6/2, 6/4'''}}　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/16, 5/19, 5/22, 5/25, 5/28, 5/31, 6/3'''}}　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/17, 5/20, 5/23, 5/26, 5/29, 6/1, 6/4'''}}　10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/18, 5/21, 5/24, 5/27, 5/30, 6/2, 6/5'''}}　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/16, 5/25, 6/3'''}}　10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/20, 5/23, 6/1'''}}　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/18, 5/27, 5/30'''}}　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM<br>
Don't miss out on this chance!

※Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared and User Rank 1600 reached.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・A relentless attack by Red enemies in the "March of Flames" map!'''}}<br>
Fight off a full-on assault by Red enemies in this limited map! Clear the map once each day to hold back the crimson invaders threatening the Cat Empire!

※ If "March of Flames" does not appear as scheduled, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent available version.<br>
※ This map will disappear after being cleared, but will reappear each day at 12:00am.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Deadly Carnival I, II, & III'''}}<br>
The toughest test is here... can you stand the heat?<br>
See if YOU are up to the challenge of these Deadly-grade stages! Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!

※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear. Players who have previously cleared Deadly Carnival I, Deadly Carnival II, or Deadly Carnival III will not be able to collect the rewards.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#3366FF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings,'''}} and {{Color|#3366FF|'''Island of Ash'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}<br>
Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!

※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (5/16, 5/18, 5/20, 5/22, 5/24, 5/26, 5/28, 5/30, 6/2, 6/4, 6/6)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00CC|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd days (5/17, 5/19, 5/21, 5/23, 5/25, 5/27, 5/29, 5/31, 6/1, 6/3, 6/5)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00CC|Into the Future}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|Cats of the Cosmos}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''5/18, 5/21, 5/24, 5/27, 5/30, 6/2 and 6/5'''}}'''!'''

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#00BAFF|'''XP Harvest'''}}  for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (4 areas)'''}}<br>
May 16th (11:00am) thru May 27th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
May 27th (11:00am) thru June 6th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catseye'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}{{Color|#FF00CC|!}}<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
May 16th (11:00am) thru May 27th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
May 27th (11:00am) thru June 6th (10:59am)

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base menu in the Battle Cats app during this campaign to earn awesome rewards!<br>
Play the game each day to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''7 Rare Tickets and 7 Normal Tickets'''}} in total!

